+# Tasks
+
+## 1. Teardown execution
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Add a shared internal teardown runner that continues through callback and signal receiver failures and reports them after all work completes; verify focused teardown tests pass.
+- [ ] 1.2 Apply the runner to request and application-context teardown while preserving registration ordering and signal arguments; verify `PYTHONPATH=src:.bench-pydeps python3 -m pytest tests/test_appctx.py -q` passes.
+
+## 2. Regression coverage
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Add request and application-context tests covering failing callbacks and signal receivers, grouped failure reporting, and restored context-local state; verify the affected test modules pass.
+- [ ] 2.2 Run the public teardown verification command and OpenSpec validation; verify both commands complete successfully.
